                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What does Rs 15L Boutique skincare launch achieve?</h3>
                                        <p>Single-sub-category focus + 30-80 SKUs + 1-2 hero product families + basic Shopify + 1 paid channel + basic SEO + Instagram + WhatsApp. Revenue Rs 2-8L/mo by month 6 + Rs 5-15L/mo by month 12. Right for first-time founder + focused validation stage.</p>
                                        <h3>What does Rs 40L Mid-market skincare launch achieve?</h3>
                                        <p>2-3 sub-categories + 80-200 SKUs + full Shopify + multi-currency + skin quiz + advanced subscription + full paid stack + full SEO + WhatsApp + derm + creator. Revenue Rs 6-15L/mo month 6 + Rs 15-35L/mo month 12 + Rs 40-90L/mo month 24.</p>
                                        <h3>What does Rs 1 Cr Full-range premium launch achieve?</h3>
                                        <p>Full range 200-500 SKUs + all sub-categories + Shopify Plus + multi-region + Arabic + Hindi + full multi-channel + celebrity + PR + editorial. Revenue Rs 15-40L/mo month 6 + Rs 40-100L/mo month 12 + Rs 1-3 Cr/mo month 24.</p>
                                        <h3>When to skip Rs 15L Boutique &amp;rarr; Rs 40L Mid-market?</h3>
                                        <p>Second-time founder + strong differentiation + capital available Rs 40L+ without stretching cash flow + multi-sub-category or India + GCC dual-market ambition year 1 + subscription + WhatsApp + advanced retention needed.</p>
                                        <h3>When to skip Rs 40L Mid-market &amp;rarr; Rs 1 Cr Full-range?</h3>
                                        <p>VC-backed + Vogue-tier + celebrity + luxury + heritage-publication essential year 1 + multi-region launch year 1 + 200+ SKU range essential + experienced founder + team + operational scale for Rs 1 Cr capex + Rs 40L+/month burn. Rare + risky.</p>
                                        <h3>What is common Rs 15L Boutique launch failure?</h3>
                                        <p>Trying to cover too many sub-categories + geographies with insufficient depth per each. Focus > breadth at Boutique tier. Single-sub-category execution wins vs 3-sub-category dilution.</p>
                                        <h3>What is common Rs 40L Mid-market launch failure?</h3>
                                        <p>Under-investing in retention + subscription + WhatsApp. Rs 40L launch WITHOUT subscription programme loses 40-60% of long-term LTV. Advanced retention essential at Mid-market.</p>
